                "end_index": 630,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Standard Wells Fargo Credit Cards\nIf you have a consumer credit card issued directly by Wells Fargo (such as the Active Cash or Autograph cards), you can log in through the main banking portal:\n* **Online Sign-On:** Go to the [Wells Fargo Homepage](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEXx7xWuUBWgLfrXm7B7TuaEH5A2JoW_01aRirTahYGN8PDpKR1vERiA7L1SUuPk8uW4SmGo8qwpR-EhwYZ6LVjcWsDJyPTiIzXraWiVyAbo3Q=)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                1
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 733,
                "end_index": 1100,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **On Mobile:** You can manage your card payments and history on the go by downloading the official application through the [Wells Fargo Mobile Banking Page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF_63uUlnhtnN6os3ye0UuIIRWKTg5cCPaGjd2kwRDJFjrDCPS6fEHKs75cwdqUFX9Sf_1KybNd0KBh3ofm8LP2X-OhbguxFtXHPNMUV9CcRi4hugWwjiDoEaWLzI1AGsoLMgVuPEbn)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1110,
                "end_index": 1640,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Retail or Store-Branded Credit Cards (Wells Fargo Retail Services)\nIf your credit card is for a specific merchant or store that partners with Wells Fargo for financing (such as home improvement, jewelry, or furniture store credit cards):\n* **Retail Sign-On:** You must use the dedicated [Wells Fargo Retail Services Cardholder Portal](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYGaxwkHM19fAiotrhpE6VIvwoGjP7qSX_TstAzt3GIS349gUePye_BuSYP-w-PnzETWKgbeXwwBZ7ukTDdv9UP1zWOBeibJEyTm7StuirIgHxoLVBj-2iCOR7WTdQ==)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                3
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1709,
                "end_index": 2059,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **First-Time Registration:** If you have a new card and have not yet set up online access, visit the [Wells Fargo Online Banking Help Page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEJcKg80GeWaQbIG6zs7IR8Xux6py-5ZakAwqAB0wSVxXYWxoeyZtTw-EJuj0HqM4XH1-eJtsTgZv3fbv2XTKSlN5F7kuNgf1vLkYvo0mktRjDqYMO5UonRqz8wJGcAX-19rq88Ig==)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
